      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,sans-serif;margin:0 4px}ul{padding-left:18px;margin:8px 0}li{margin:4px 0}</style><ul><li>New: your todos sync with iCloud. Sign in to the same iCloud account on each Mac, and the same todos show on all of them. There is no account or server of Perch's own.</li><li>Undo takes back only your own change. It never removes a todo that came from another Mac.</li><li>`perch status` shows whether iCloud sync and its push updates are on.</li></ul>]]></description>
